flowchart TB
 D["READ THE RESPONSE"]
 D -->|engaged| A["ANSWER<br/>Stay in the same story"]
 D -->|doubt or silence| B["BOUND THE EFFORT<br/>Reassure or follow up"]
 D -->|explicit rejection| C["CLOSE THE BRANCH<br/>Record the objection"]
 A --> M["SAVE THE LESSON<br/>Inform the next step"]
 B --> M
 C --> M
 D -->|stop requested| S["END CONTACT"]
